#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Léarscáileanna"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Taispeáin ar léarscáil cá bhfuil na cuideachtaí, agus gach seoladh poist curtha as líne ag a chód poist nó ag a bhaile ó tháblaí a choinnítear ar an bhfreastalaí seo, nó san áit ar chuir tú de láimh é; ní tharraingítear seoladh teagmhálaí ná do sheoladh féin ach nuair a iarrann tú é, agus coinnítear a bpointí leo agus scriostar in éineacht leo iad. Tarraingíonn Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) an léarscáil thar thíleanna OpenStreetMap (© rannpháirtithe OpenStreetMap, ODbL) mura roghnaíonn na Socruithe tíleanna eile nó gan aon tíleanna; foghlaimíonn OpenStreetMap ansin seoladh gach duine a fhéachann air agus an ceantar a bhfuil sé ag féachaint air. Tagann áiteanna ó GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; a chóid poist CC BY 4.0), ainmneacha na dtíortha ó Unicode CLDR trí Babel, agus imlíne an domhain ó Natural Earth (fearann poiblí). Múchta, níl leathanach léarscáile ann agus ní chuirtear aon seoladh ar léarscáil; fanann na comhordanáidí atá stóráilte cheana taifeadta agus tagann siad ar ais gan athrú nuair a chuirtear ar siúl arís é."
